ntas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px; text-decoration-line: none !important;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2033550866/Qantas_Business_Rewards_eDM_Banner2_680x70.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 10px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2038610241/QBR-CVP-Phase-2-EDM-header_680x400.gif" title="Qantas Business Rewards" alt="Qantas Business Rewards" width="680"></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table class="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 30px; height: 30px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px; margin: 0px;"><h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px; font-weight: 400; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Classic Upgrade Rewards now available via your Qantas Business Rewards account</font></h2></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>We recently made the flying benefits of Qantas Business Rewards even better, introducing more rewards, bigger savings and greater value. As part of these enhancements, you can now use points for&nbsp;<strong>Classic Upgrade Rewards directly from your Qantas Business Rewards account.<sup style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">**</sup></strong><br><br>This means you'll no longer have to transfer your business's points to a Qantas Frequent Flyer account when requesting a flight upgrade. Simply login to your Qantas Business Rewards account and use points to upgrade you or your team.<sup style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">^^</sup>&nbsp;You'll need 'use points' permissions enabled on your profile.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 30px; height: 30px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; width: 680px;"><a href="http://qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/manage-bookings" title="Steps on how to request a Classic Upgrade Reward" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px; text-decoration-line: none !important;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2038610186/Phase+2+Request+Classic+Upgrade+Reward+680px.jpg" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 30px; height: 30px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">In addition to this exciting new feature, you can continue to use points to book a Classic Flight Reward<sup style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 8px;">*</sup>&nbsp;or Points Plus Pay<sup style="font-size: 9px; line-height: 8px;">&gt;</sup>&nbsp;flight directly from your Qantas Business Rewards account. Saving time and money on travel expenses for you and your team, so you can let your business fly.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="http://qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/manage-bookings" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(1